Subject: [PATCH RFC] apple: replay native DP HPD after DRM readiness

Opt-in static native route with serialized state replay and checked
withdrawal before Type-C reconfiguration. Refuse a simultaneous DP-IN
consumer. A partial firmware error blocks the route until reset.

Development candidate: dynamic port arbitration, HPD IRQ and system
suspend are not implemented. Native-bound system suspend is rejected.
No claim of upstream-ready bindings or API.

---
